{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:651","content":{"id":651,"title":"视口、viewBox 与 preserveAspectRatio","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"56f69a06-1ae8-42f5-b7bc-4b782718f7d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视口"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"28894406-ea23-4128-8b14-2a6b6eee88a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 包含一个"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"无限大"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的画布，但是视口(viewport)限制了我们只能看到一部分，就像是你在屋子里面通过窗子看外面的风景，外面的世界很大，但是窗子的大小是有限的，所以你只能看到一部分，这里的窗子就是视口的作用，它限制了你能看到的画布的大小。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"80bd0e42-c7c7-4847-9c1f-8e146b0897dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"width"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"height "},{"type":"formatted","text":"属性规定视口的大小，如果没有指定这两个属性，默认视口大小为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"300\\text{px} \\times 150\\text{px}","collabId":"b9cc6506-3221-4dd9-83a6-bbf8351e1786","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"300\\text{px} \\times 150\\text{px}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"ed019bc3-c37a-43b4-b50f-9a1dcc38bbd7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"59a3e5df-6a24-45a4-81e0-029d78702087","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"80d8c83f-7a29-4e58-bda7-faab7e8c17d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"79cf7cd0-d9b3-4555-855b-677acb15b062","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe4d86d6-0ec6-4484-a06b-96d1fb715ea4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们规定了视口的大小为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"2649132d-411b-47b8-9d51-39745c7f3aa4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后我们在画布上画了一个圆，该圆的圆心为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(100, 100)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，半径为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"50"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，经过简单计算就知道该圆只有左上角在视口中，其他部分在视口之外，我们只能看到左上角的圆。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"56700cb4-a52a-4c48-8d27-5c7d1edf3f6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"viewBox"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"859b9fb2-cbaf-4fb1-ab1e-ad1a408f748f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，我们规定视口大小、圆心坐标和半径时并没有指定单位，对于视口来说，默认单位是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"svg"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 内的形状来说，如果没有指定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，默认也是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e42eb7e-1213-4b53-b4b2-57ccc0801d35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以现在有一个问题，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是什么？可以认为它规定了"},{"type":"formatted","highlight":"yellow","text":"视口的逻辑大小"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它需要指定四个值 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox=\"min-x min-y width height\""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"50eb7998-7964-462e-9fa6-a37e3502d171","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47be4cbe-5b6d-4b42-b8b3-092989f49654","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f472c473-a72e-4414-8660-c83df6701da1","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(min-x, min-y)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：视口左上角在画布中的坐标"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ef5259c9-03ed-461b-9b8e-973ec53496c4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"130d35eb-66de-4912-b958-5efc33bfebbc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"width, height"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：视口在画布中的大小"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c910424-45c1-496e-a976-b131b612dc76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这四个值通过空格或者逗号分隔开，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(min-x, min-y)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 我们先不理它，稍后我们看它怎么回事，暂且将它设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(0, 0)"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"7fca0fe3-84c2-453d-b75d-ed14c31e2395","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dbe195d1-87ee-4f97-8d14-fb508e0d409e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>\n<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"0459a91a-4d29-468d-9dcc-62cc5eb51fdb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6c353327-40ae-4319-be18-1410d67b5d60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们定义了两个 SVG，视口大小都为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"b3e9c0e4-e20c-45af-9bf3-a3f1f10b2251","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 大小不同，第一个 SVG 定义的视口逻辑大小也为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"0f4c260d-66c0-4edb-af34-1371d24c7400","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是一个逻辑大小单位等价于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而第二个视口逻辑大小为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"200 \\times 200","collabId":"95d7331f-630d-4caf-8528-4754b5707966","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"200 \\times 200"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说一个逻辑大小单位等价于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0.5px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2db3fbe9-9a8e-48ff-840d-6bf5050bb509","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我们明确一点，当我们指定了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之后，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"svg"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的内容用的单位就是逻辑单位而不是像素了。因为在两个 SVG 中，它们逻辑大小单位不同，所以即使定义相同参数的圆，但是在画布上显示的单位是不一样的，如下："}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>\n<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"426278f3-96eb-4665-84b6-a44be9e66c57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"117a1f13-33dd-4fb5-b21e-7d68c320e872","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们绘制内容时就无需关注视口的 CSS 大小了，因为视口的逻辑大小由 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 确定，当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不变时，改变视口的 CSS 大小，就可以产生对内容进行缩放，并且 SVG 中各内容的相对位置不会发生改变。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"01c4124e-103b-4012-9d33-64301b2b337a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后讲一下 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"min-x"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"min-y"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它定义了视口能显示的最小坐标（当然坐标的单位是逻辑单位），也就是视口左上角的坐标是多少，之前我们定义的最小坐标是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(0, 0)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说视口的左上角的坐标是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(0, 0)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2acc133e-d2d2-4b23-84f0-6a82d1b75c58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑开头的例子"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"70a58030-2cf7-4cba-83d6-fcf4b36b3e88","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"94bcaa98-d3e0-45e5-b6b9-50a271aaf2df","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"20447010-e20b-4c8d-860a-d7557fd15c8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"9fdd5e66-dfcb-4a87-b2ea-b326f823cc73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"399ae32d-aad7-4453-89b7-f8d781157893","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为这个圆只有左上角在视口中，所以只会显示左上四分之一圆，现在我们决定将左上角的坐标设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(50, 50)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，就可以使得整个圆都在视口中了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"5559631e-1643-4de2-acea-d456b055ca0a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f0a41c57-ffdb-456e-8473-8fffdcad5d2d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"50 50 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"a9498fa3-bc53-444a-92eb-4b8e64cb5423","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"50 50 100 100\">\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"c108bef3-5aa2-4443-85c9-565a0aa19f32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8eabc4b1-984c-4c8a-8b89-a0d0d1e6a938","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"min-x, min-y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为非零值时，就相当于对画布进行了平移，一般情况下我们都是设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1f4b9df8-46e2-448f-a64f-8c25cbf624a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"preserveAspectRatio"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19796de1-f3a8-46c7-923a-d693a54b22de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"viewBox"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定的逻辑大小与真正的视口大小它们的宽高比是一样的，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"201b089e-4de6-41c7-9da0-c3268d02b4b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的视口大小与对应于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"5fdc4daa-44ec-45d6-af7c-424b20a0ac2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"200 \\times 200","collabId":"2960f166-ae2b-4817-96d7-d7b584c36c4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"200 \\times 200"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的逻辑大小，它们的宽高比是相同的."}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f606150-6922-46de-8d8a-47344bd8fbeb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果它们的宽高比不同呢？例如视口大小是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"200 \\times 300","collabId":"d3aedcb5-cd33-4d95-97e7-d45b49bba925","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"200 \\times 300"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是逻辑大小是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"100 \\times 100","collabId":"dd1a2d00-dfd9-4df9-b1e6-de8200416e25","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100 \\times 100"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那像素与逻辑单位的换算是如何计算的？是按最小的算（高，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"100 -> 200"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）还是按最大的算（宽，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"100 -> 300"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）？这个就由 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"preserveAspectRatio"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性规定。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"d51a378f-1814-4570-a3e4-768aef519283","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"efda4db1-92c0-4d82-903c-2cc87e5b112f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"300\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">\n  <image x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" xlink:href=\"xxx.png\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"a399627c-3162-4e17-8419-398d366d2d99","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"300\" height=\"200